z","toi","le","site","ne","garde","rien"],"empreinte":"b4062f5b47470279e92699be0a8dd40f0d453286a90626f9cd326196d0c6f741","merkle":{"feuille":206,"chemin":[{"cote":"droite","digest":"b2d758570ace0838d5df2d608dd16209ea156e987e292a365920dd15499b2d60"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"bc7f7929d51303e31adec672a5eff415816633986656edd2b2d1cd9faa0838a8"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"cb91d820400dfa147d806b8a24dd8b46114a7a33243cc8b58a326780475a418d"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"1643545a4cb39b320b5fd61169e768891d7f77ea152eae93302e6296d8f9eac5"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"726562c6d8cf027c7c18b1e0f50623f381935a0ad322562ba1e5f2c662c9ff24"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"6eacc0c1750f78b43cc60d83a0c3a09c38f20c5be5a5004cfbb1a0b0ea4658e5"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"35bb3360f798e767433de9562880ae5e4200860cfb53e7f05339aebfec315905"}]}},{"id":207,"page":"cerveau.html","ancre":"cerveau-libre","titre":"Ou pose ta question en texte libre","panneau":"Parle avec le site web SoPHIa","texte":"✎ Ou pose ta question en texte libre Écris ta question avec tes mots : le site la route, il ne l’improvise pas. D’abord les mots-clés sur les questions préparées. Puis le noyau du site cherche dans son index plein texte — l’index de tous les passages du site, construit d’avance : ta phrase exacte d’abord, tes mots ensuite, séparément, et chaque réponse est une citation montrée avec sa pièce, son chemin de preuve et — quand un parcours du site correspond — le bouton de l’action, qui nomme le geste et mène à l’étape exacte. Puis, si tu as activé le palier P1 (la recherche par le sens, à la section des paliers ci-dessous), ta question est cherchée par le sens — un modèle de plongement français servi par ce site, calculé dans ton navigateur, sans que rien parte. Ensuite, en filet, les mots-clés sur l’index des endroits du site. Si rien ne tient mot pour mot, un appariement par recouvrement de mots propose les questions préparées les plus proches. Et si rien ne tient du tout, la porte du courriel s’ouvre, dite honnêtement — le relais courriel du site, le seul lien qui existe vers SoPHIa l’agente, asynchrone et tracé dans le mail. Aucune réponse n’est inventée. Ta question Demander au site","mots":["ou","pose","ta","question","en","texte","libre","ecris","ta","question","avec","tes","mots","le","site","la","route","il","ne","l","improvise","pas","d","abord","les","mots-cles","sur","les","questions","preparees","puis","le","noyau","du","site","cherche","dans","son","index","plein","texte","l","index","de","tous","les","passages","du","site","construit","d","avance","ta","phrase","exacte","d","abord","tes","mots","ensuite","separement","et","chaque","reponse","est","une","citation","montree","avec","sa","piece","son","chemin","de","preuve","et","quand","un","parcours","du","site","correspond","le","bouton","de","l","action","qui","nomme","le","geste","et","mene","a","l","etape","exacte","puis","si","tu","as","active","le","palier","p1","la","recherche","par","le","sens","a","la","section","des","paliers","ci-dessous","ta","question","est","cherchee","par","le","sens","un","modele","de","plongement","francais","servi","par","ce","site","calcule","dans","ton","navigateur","sans","que","rien","parte","ensuite","en","filet","les","mots-cles","sur","l","index","des","endroits","du","site","si","rien","ne","tient","mot","pour","mot","un","appariement","par","recouvrement","de","mots","propose","les","questions","preparees","les","plus","proches","et","si","rien","ne","tient","du","tout","la","porte","du","courriel","s","ouvre","dite","honnetement","le","relais","courriel","du","site","le","seul","lien","qui","existe","vers","sophia","l","agente","asynchrone","et","trace","dans","le","mail","aucune","reponse","n","est","inventee","ta","question","demander","au","site"],"empreinte":"b2d758570ace0838d5df2d608dd16209ea156e987e292a365920dd15499b2d60","merkle":{"feuille":207,"chemin":[{"cote":"gauche","digest":"b4062f5b47470279e92699be0a8dd40f0d453286a90626f9cd326196d0c6f741"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"bc7f7929d51303e31adec672a5eff415816633986656edd2b2d1cd9faa0838a8"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"cb91d820400dfa147d806b8a24dd8b46114a7a33243cc8b58a326780475a418d"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"1643545a4cb39b320b5fd61169e768891d7f77ea152eae93302e6296d8f9eac5"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"726562c6d8cf027c7c18b1e0f50623f381935a0ad322562ba1e5f2c662c9ff24"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"6eacc0c1750f78b43cc60d83a0c3a09c38f20c5be5a5004cfbb1a0b0ea4658e5"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"35bb3360f798e767433de9562880ae5e4200860cfb53e7f05339aebfec315905"}]}},{"id":208,"page":"cerveau.html","ancre":"cerveau-noyau","titre":"Le noyau du site — SoPHIa, mémoire cumulative chaînée","panneau":"Parle avec le site web SoPHIa","texte":"❖ Le noyau du site — SoPHIa, mémoire cumulative chaînée Le noyau de ce site porte un nom, donné par Alexandre le 24 novembre 2026 : SoPHIa, mémoire cumulative chaînée — et sécurisée : sécurisée par ses sceaux, dont chaque réponse montre le chemin, et par ce qu’elle ne fait pas — elle ne reçoit rien, elle ne garde rien, elle n’invente rien. Ce site agit comme une intelligence qui répond : tu lui écris, par mots ou par phrases, et il répond à partir de ce qu’il tient — son index. L’index est construit d’avance, à partir de tous les passages du site : un mot y pointe vers chacune de ses occurrences, avec son contexte ; une phrase y est cherchée telle quelle, avant d’être décomposée en mots. Le noyau compose sa réponse uniquement de citations du site, chacune montrée avec sa pièce (la page et l’endroit) et son chemin de Merkle, que ton appareil peut revérifier sur-le-champ — et le lien de chaque occurrence mène à l’occurrence elle-même, dans la pièce. Quand un passage tenu mène à un parcours ou à une démarche du site — tes droits, une demande de données, un recours — la réponse porte le bouton de l’action : il nomme le geste et mène à l’étape exacte. Ce que l’index ne tient pas, le noyau le dit — et la porte du courriel s’ouvre, la seule action qui reste. Plus le site est nourri, plus son index grandit, et plus ses réponses s’affinent : c’est la loi de croissance de sa mémoire cumulative. Et le site se rappelle de toi — ici, chez toi : ta conversation avec lui est chaînée par SHA-256, chiffrée au repos (AES-GCM, clé d’appareil générée et gardée dans ton navigateur), et conservée dans ton appareil seulement — la section « Ton parcours », ci-dessous, la montre et la revérifie à ton retour. Les questions que tu poses au noyau et les pièces qu’il te montre y deviennent des entrées comme les autres. Le site ne garde aucune copie : sa mémoire de toi vit dans ton téléphone, pas sur un serveur — et si tu perds ta clé d’appareil, elle devient illisible pour tout le monde : c’est le prix de ta souveraineté, nommé tel quel à la section du parcours. Le noyau n’est pas encore chargé sur cette page : son index (environ 3 Mo, en éclats par chambre) se charge depuis ce site seulement, à ta première question en texte libre — ou tout de suite, par le bouton ci-dessous. Rien d’autre ne se télécharge, et rien ne part. Charger le noyau du site","mots":["le","noyau","du","site","sophia","memoire","cumulative","chainee","le","noyau","de","ce","site","porte","un","nom","donne","par","alexandre","le","24","novembre","2026","sophia","memoire","cumulative","chainee","et","securisee","securisee","par","ses","sceaux","dont","chaque","reponse","montre","le","chemin","et","par","ce","qu","elle","ne","fait","pas","elle","ne","recoit","rien","elle","ne","garde","rien","elle","n","invente","rien","ce","site","agit","comme","une","intelligence","qui","repond","tu","lui","ecris","par","mots","ou","par","phrases","et","il","repond","a","partir","de","ce","qu","il","tient","son","index","l","index","est","construit","d","avance","a","partir","de","tous","les","passages","du","site","un","mot","y","pointe","vers","chacune","de","ses","occurrences","avec","son","contexte","une","phrase","y","est","cherchee","telle","quelle","avant","d","etre","decomposee","en","mots","le","noyau","compose","sa","reponse","uniquement","de","citations","du","site","chacune","montree","avec","sa","piece","la","page","et","l","endroit","et","son","chemin","de","merkle","que","ton","appareil","peut","reverifier","sur-le-champ","et","le","lien","de","chaque","occurrence","mene","a","l","occurrence","elle-meme","dans","la","piece","quand","un","passage","tenu","mene","a","un","parcours","ou","a","une","demarche","du","site","tes","droits","une","demande","de","donnees","un","recours","la","reponse","porte","le","bouton","de","l","action","il","nomme","le","geste","et","mene","a","l","etape","exacte","ce","que","l","index","ne","tient","pas","le","noyau","le","dit","et","la","porte","du","courriel","s","ouvre","la","seule","action","qui","reste","plus","le","site","est","nourri","plus","son","index","grandit","et","plus","ses","reponses","s","affinent","c","est","la","loi","de","croissance","de","sa","memoire","cumulative","et","le","site","se","rappelle","de","toi","ici","chez","toi","ta","conversation","avec","lui","est","chainee","par","sha-256","chiffree","au","repos","aes-gcm","cle","d","appareil","generee","et","gardee","dans","ton","navigateur","et","conservee","dans","ton","appareil","seulement","la","section","ton","parcours","ci-dessous","la","montre","et","la","reverifie","a","ton","retour","les","questions","que","tu","poses","au","noyau","et","les","pieces","qu","il","te","montre","y","deviennent","des","entrees","comme","les","autres","le","site","ne","garde","aucune","copie","sa","memoire","de","toi","vit","dans","ton","telephone","pas","sur","un","serveur","et","si","tu","perds","ta","cle","d","appareil","elle","devient","illisible","pour","tout","le","monde","c","est","le","prix","de","ta","souverainete","nomme","tel","quel","a","la","section","du","parcours","le","noyau","n","est","pas","encore","charge","sur","cette","page","son","index","environ","3","mo","en","eclats","par","chambre","se","charge","depuis","ce","site","seulement","a","ta","premiere","question","en","texte","libre","ou","tout","de","suite","par","le","bouton","ci-dessous","rien","d","autre","ne","se","telecharge","et","rien","ne","part","charger","le","noyau","du","site"],"empreinte":"c60efcebabade0f68b44c9f8c84d10735746a62a89fe5f09992e98f40359993d","merkle":{"feuille":208,"chemin":[{"cote":"droite","digest":"b2932c4ba4d14dd79a8b9b9f7338a03ee08fb46566cf0df461770a58986a7ff3"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"4cc9b930f02f6ae9004b2b77c2ab8ae5ec429c77e71f97b0cb14e130f7961a8f"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"effa3b2956817b7b830c34a3b1b357b340f724bdba120df6e1f82b9b6e88e310"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"ea4cbdec75b94498048ed77045e2c4dc40c72cffb4b1e8b548c897ff8b696bc5"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"6eacc0c1750f78b43cc60d83a0c3a09c38f20c5be5a5004cfbb1a0b0ea4658e5"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"35bb3360f798e767433de9562880ae5e4200860cfb53e7f05339aebfec315905"}]}},{"id":209,"page":"cerveau.html","ancre":"cerveau-parcours","titre":"Ton parcours — une conversation chaînée, gardée sur ton appareil","panneau":"Parle avec le site web SoPHIa","texte":"⛓ Ton parcours — une conversation chaînée, gardée sur ton appareil Chaque pas de ta conversation devient une entrée de ton cerveau local : entrée nº n, chaînée aux précédentes — état n = SHA-256(état n−1 + entrée n ), genèse = 64 zéros. L’historique vit dans le stockage local de ton appareil seulement ; le site ne le reçoit ni ne le garde. À ton retour, cette page le relit et le revérifie depuis ton appareil, et consigne ton retour comme une entrée de plus : la conversation elle-même est une mémoire cumulative, avec sa preuve de retour. Cette mémoire est aussi chiffrée au repos , dans ton appareil : une clé d’appareil AES-GCM, générée ici même par WebCrypto, non extractible, gardée dans ce navigateur — ni le site ni son opérateur ne la détiennent, et ne peuvent donc pas lire ta mémoire. La chaîne se revérifie après déchiffrement, dans ton appareil seulement. Borne, dite franchement : si tu perds cette clé — en effaçant les données de ce navigateur, ou en changeant d’appareil — ta mémoire devient illisible, pour tout le monde et pour toujours. C’est le prix de ta souveraineté : une mémoire que personne d’autre ne peut lire est aussi une mémoire que personne ne peut te rouvrir. État actuel de ta chaîne : — Exporter mon historique (JSON) Effacer mon historique de cet appareil","mots":["ton","parcours","une","conversation","chainee","gardee","sur","ton","appareil","chaque","pas","de","ta","conversation","devient","une","entree","de","ton","cerveau","local","entree","n","n","chainee","aux","precedentes","etat","n","sha-256","etat","n","1","entree","n","genese","64","zeros","l","historique","vit","dans","le","stockage","local","de","ton","appareil","seulement","le","site","ne","le","recoit","ni","ne","le","garde","a","ton","retour","cette","page","le","relit","et","le","reverifie","depuis","ton","appareil","et","consigne","ton","retour","comme","une","entree","de","plus","la","conversation","elle-meme","est","une","memoire","cumulative","avec","sa","preuve","de","retour","cette","memoire","est","aussi","chiffree","au","repos","dans","ton","appareil","une","cle","d","appareil","aes-gcm","generee","ici","meme","par","webcrypto","non","extractible","gardee","dans","ce","navigateur","ni","le","site","ni","son","operateur","ne","la","detiennent","et","ne","peuvent","donc","pas","lire","ta","memoire","la","chaine","se","reverifie","apres","dechiffrement","dans","ton","appareil","seulement","borne","dite","franchement","si","tu","perds","cette","cle","en","effacant","les","donnees","de","ce","navigateur","ou","en","changeant","d","appareil","ta","memoire","devient","illisible","pour","tout","le","monde","et","pour","toujours","c","est","le","prix","de","ta","souverainete","une","memoire","que","personne","d","autre","ne","peut","lire","est","aussi","une","memoire","que","personne","ne","peut","te","rouvrir","etat","actuel","de","ta","chaine","exporter","mon","historique","json","effacer","mon","historique","de","cet","appareil"],"empreinte":"b2932c4ba4d14dd79a8b9b9f7338a03ee08fb46566cf0df461770a58986a7ff3","merkle":{"feuille":209,"chemin":[{"cote":"gauche","digest":"c60efcebabade0f68b44c9f8c84d10735746a62a89fe5f09992e98f40359993d"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"4cc9b930f02f6ae9004b2b77c2ab8ae5ec429c77e71f97b0cb14e130f7961a8f"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"effa3b2956817b7b830c34a3b1b357b340f724bdba120df6e1f82b9b6e88e310"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"ea4cbdec75b94498048ed77045e2c4dc40c72cffb4b1e8b548c897ff8b696bc5"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"6eacc0c1750f78b43cc60d83a0c3a09c38f20c5be5a5004cfbb1a0b0ea4658e5"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"35bb3360f798e767433de9562880ae5e4200860cfb53e7f05339aebfec315905"}]}},{"id":210,"page":"cerveau.html","ancre":"cerveau-paliers","titre":"Les paliers — la profondeur que ton appareil peut porter","panneau":"Parle avec le site web SoPHIa","texte":"▲ Les paliers — la profondeur que ton appareil peut porter Ce site ne se limite pas à une seule forme : il donne le plus de capacités qu’il peut, et c’est ton appareil qui décide de la profondeur. Le plancher est le même pour tous — le labyrinthe et la recherche par mots-clés de cette salle, qui ne demandent rien de spécial. Au-dessus, les paliers se débloquent selon les capacités réelles de l’appareil : plus un téléphone est récent, plus il porte de paliers, plus l’expérience a de profondeur. Et l’échelle est ouverte : elle se bâtit pour les générations futures — les téléphones fonctionnels d’aujourd’hui seront les vieux téléphones de demain, les paliers de demain s’ajouteront comme des couches, sans rebâtir le site, et chacun gardera la place que ses capacités lui donnent. La détection se fait ici, dans ton navigateur, à partir des capacités réelles — WebGPU, WebAssembly, la mémoire et les cœurs que ton appareil expose, la largeur de ton écran — jamais à partir du nom ou du modèle de ton téléphone. Rien ne part : aucune mesure n’est envoyée ni gardée, le site ne reçoit rien. Et l’affichage est honnête : un palier que le site n’a pas encore livré est nommé « pas encore », un palier prêt mais pas branché est nommé « prêt » — rien n’est simulé. Ton palier se calcule chez toi, par le script de cette page. Sans lui, la base te sert déjà au complet : le labyrinthe et la recherche par mots-clés, ci-dessus.","mots":["les","paliers","la","profondeur","que","ton","appareil","peut","porter","ce","site","ne","se","limite","pas","a","une","seule","forme","il","donne","le","plus","de","capacites","qu","il","peut","et","c","est","ton","appareil","qui","decide","de","la","profondeur","le","plancher","est","le","meme","pour","tous","le","labyrinthe","et","la","recherche","par","mots-cles","de","cette","salle","qui","ne","demandent","rien","de","special","au-dessus","les","paliers","se","debloquent","selon","les","capacites","reelles","de","l","appareil","plus","un","telephone","est","recent","plus","il","porte","de","paliers","plus","l","experience","a","de","profondeur","et","l","echelle","est","ouverte","elle","se","batit","pour","les","generations","futures","les","telephones","fonctionnels","d","aujourd","hui","seront","les","vieux","telephones","de","demain","les","paliers","de","demain","s","ajouteront","comme","des","couches","sans","rebatir","le","site","et","chacun","gardera","la","place","que","ses","capacites","lui","donnent","la","detection","se","fait","ici","dans","ton","navigateur","a","partir","des","capacites","reelles","webgpu","webassembly","la","memoire","et","les","c","urs","que","ton","appareil","expose","la","largeur","de","ton","ecran","jamais","a","partir","du","nom","ou","du","modele","de","ton","telephone","rien","ne","part","aucune","mesure","n","est","envoyee","ni","gardee","le","site","ne","recoit","rien","et","l","affichage","est","honnete","un","palier","que","le","site","n","a","pas","encore","livre","est","nomme","pas","encore","un","palier","pret","mais","pas","branche","est","nomme","pret","rien","n","est","simule","ton","palier","se","calcule","chez","toi","par","le","script","de","cette","page","sans","lui","la","base","te","sert","deja","au","complet","le","labyrinthe","et","la","recherche","par","mots-cles","ci-dessus"],"empreinte":"405315638c20f4d0714c280173b6df4ef439e60e3445a162076a781594af011b","merkle":{"feuille":210,"chemin":[{"cote":"droite","digest":"e631e0ce8a3a6c547a1a6052aee70c27fa1d884660f8f04e49f044cc6fe8d729"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"510d43243716c5610d7784933c8bb4c649eed5bfbff2cc5f63fa803a363db5fe"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"effa3b2956817b7b830c34a3b1b357b340f724bdba120df6e1f82b9b6e88e310"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"ea4cbdec75b94498048ed77045e2c4dc40c72cffb4b1e8b548c897ff8b696bc5"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"6eacc0c1750f78b43cc60d83a0c3a09c38f20c5be5a5004cfbb1a0b0ea4658e5"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"35bb3360f798e767433de9562880ae5e4200860cfb53e7f05339aebfec315905"}]}},{"id":211,"page":"cerveau.html","ancre":"cerveau-preuve","titre":"Comment la preuve marche ici","panneau":"Parle avec le site web SoPHIa","texte":"✓ Comment la preuve marche ici Les … réponses préparées de la conversation sont les feuilles d’un arbre de Merkle (assets/arbre-cerveau.json) : le digest de chaque feuille est le SHA-256 de sa forme canonique, les nœuds combinent les digests deux à deux, et la racine engage l’ensemble — toute réponse modifiée change sa feuille, donc la racine. À chaque fin de chemin, cette page recalcule devant toi le chemin de la feuille jusqu’à la racine, et peut aussi recalculer l’empreinte de l’endroit qui porte la réponse contre le manifeste chaîné du site — le même calcul que le kit autonome, dans ton navigateur. Racine de l’arbre de la conversation : … Le nourrissage : l’arbre et l’index de la conversation sont générés depuis un fichier source éditable (cerveau-source.json, au chantier du site). La ronde quotidienne nourrit le site en connaissance : ajouter une réponse possible, c’est ajouter une feuille à la source et reconstruire — la racine bouge, le manifeste se re-scelle, et la nouvelle réponse paraît avec son chemin de preuve comme les autres. Aucune réponse ne s’ajoute en silence dans un coin du code. Borne, écrite et tenue : un sceau prouve qu’un contenu existait à une date et n’a pas changé depuis. Il ne tranche pas la vérité du contenu, quel qu’en soit l’auteur.","mots":["comment","la","preuve","marche","ici","les","reponses","preparees","de","la","conversation","sont","les","feuilles","d","un","arbre","de","merkle","assets","arbre-cerveau","json","le","digest","de","chaque","feuille","est","le","sha-256","de","sa","forme","canonique","les","n","uds","combinent","les","digests","deux","a","deux","et","la","racine","engage","l","ensemble","toute","reponse","modifiee","change","sa","feuille","donc","la","racine","a","chaque","fin","de","chemin","cette","page","recalcule","devant","toi","le","chemin","de","la","feuille","jusqu","a","la","racine","et","peut","aussi","recalculer","l","empreinte","de","l","endroit","qui","porte","la","reponse","contre","le","manifeste","chaine","du","site","le","meme","calcul","que","le","kit","autonome","dans","ton","navigateur","racine","de","l","arbre","de","la","conversation","le","nourrissage","l","arbre","et","l","index","de","la","conversation","sont","generes","depuis","un","fichier","source","editable","cerveau-source","json","au","chantier","du","site","la","ronde","quotidienne","nourrit","le","site","en","connaissance","ajouter","une","reponse","possible","c","est","ajouter","une","feuille","a","la","source","et","reconstruire","la","racine","bouge","le","manifeste","se","re-scelle","et","la","nouvelle","reponse","parait","avec","son","chemin","de","preuve","comme","les","autres","aucune","reponse","ne","s","ajoute","en","silence","dans","un","coin","du","code","borne","ecrite","et","tenue","un","sceau","prouve","qu","un","contenu","existait","a","une","date","et","n","a","pas","change","depuis","il","ne","tranche","pas","la","verite","du","contenu","quel","qu","en","soit",